  /// The source address prefix or tag to match for the rule. Valid values are a single IP address (i.e. 192.0.2.10), IP subnet (i.e. 192.0.2.0/24), default tag, or * (for all addresses).  If any other values are provided the request fails with HTTP status code 400.
